<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_66b005a6484e5a6e96e40015102d69efc8bc0d0cc9a2a807f86d748d49b3068d_n0108/e_0068> <http://digistrucmed.org/spanConfidence> "1.0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_66b005a6484e5a6e96e40015102d69efc8bc0d0cc9a2a807f86d748d49b3068d_n0108/tu_0013> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "For women planning pregnancy imminently, modification of HF pharmacotherapy including: discontinuation of any ACEi, ARB, ARNi, MRA, or SGLT2i or ivabradine medications; within a construct of multidisciplinary shared decision-making, continuation of a beta blocker (most commonly metoprolol), hydralazine, and nitrates; adjustment of diuretic dosing to minimize the risk of placental hypoperfusion." .
